    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Charming Two-Storey Townhouse in a Convenient Town Centre Location\r\nNestled within the attractive and well-maintained Bridgecourt development, this delightful two-storey townhouse offers comfortable, low-maintenance living in a highly convenient location.\r\nThe accommodation is thoughtfully laid out and comprises a bright and spacious living room that flows seamlessly into an open-plan kitchen, creating an inviting space for both everyday living and entertaining. Upstairs, there are two generous double bedrooms, each benefiting from built-in wardrobes, together with a well-appointed shower room.\r\nSet within a small residential development, this property enjoys a peaceful setting while being just a short stroll from Ballinasloe town centre. A wide range of amenities are within easy walking distance, including shops, supermarkets, cafés, restaurants, schools, churches, sporting facilities, and public transport links, making it an ideal choice for first-time buyers, downsizers, or investors alike.\r\nThis is an excellent opportunity to acquire a well-presented home in a sought-after location, combining convenience, comfort, and excellent value."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Car parking\r\nBuilt in stove\r\nFully tiled showerroom\r\nClose to a host of amenities\r\nWalking distance of Ballinasloe town center\r\nOwn door entrance\r\nEasy to maintain property"
      },
